			"widgets_values":[
				"This is a vibrant,digitally created poster for the children's animated film \"Happy Ever.\" The central figure is a young boy with brown hair and a joyful expression,captured mid-jump with his arms and legs spread wide. He is wearing a bright yellow T-shirt with the word \"Happy\" on it,blue jeans,and sneakers. A black backpack is slung over his shoulders. The background features a lush,green forest with rolling hills and a clear blue sky dotted with fluffy white clouds.,\nTo the left and right,there are whimsical,colorful amusement park rides: a Ferris wheel on the left and a carousel on the right,both with vibrant colors and detailed designs. Surrounding the boy are several small,adorable creatures with big eyes and friendly expressions,adding to the cheerful atmosphere.,\nThe title \"Happy Ever\" is prominently displayed at the top in a playful,yellow font with stars and a rainbow effect. Below the title,the text reads,\"Harting as Bessie Dutton,\" followed by contact information including a phone number and website. The bottom of the poster features additional text and a logo for \"the Happy Ever Project.\" The overall style is vibrant and cartoonish,aimed at children and evoking a sense of joy and adventure.,"
